Tracked-forward items from 020P (RULE-001 Phase 2)\n249:## Tracked-forward items from WP-SCP-023 023A (plan-doc) + 023B (emitter) + 023C (aggregator)\n271:## Tracked-forward items from 020H.4 (rule-config canary)\n316:## Tracked-forward items from WP-SCP-024 024B-core / 024B-extras\n321:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-RESTORE-PATH-CONTAINMENT-001** (open): apply `resolve_inside_repo_root()` guard to `scripts/enable-required-check.sh --restore <path>` argument in 024B-extras-2 alongside other defensive hardening. Low blast-radius (operator-credentials-bound). Owner: 024B-extras-2 slice; does NOT gate 024C.\n322:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-COHORT-REGEX-MULTICHAR-001** (open): widen `.github/workflows/check-invocation-log-entry.yml` cohort regex from `024[C-F]/` to `024[C-F][^/]*/` for future multi-char cohort slice IDs. Current 5-cohort set (024C/D/E/F) is single-char and unaffected; defensive. Owner: 024B-extras-2 slice; does NOT gate 024C.\n324:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-STAGED-RESTORE-TEST-001** (open): add test case for staged-but-uncommitted prior-restore evidence in 024B-extras-2 tests (guards against future narrowing of `git diff HEAD` to `git diff`). Owner: 024B-extras-2 slice.\n325:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-SET-EQ-001** (open): restore verify-phase set-equality comparison (deferred from 024B-extras-1 carve per `SCOPE-CORRECTION-2-2026-05-11.md`). Closure: `scripts/enable-required-check.sh` verify phase uses jq sorted-set comparison for `required_status_checks.contexts`. NOT BLOCKING 024C — extras-1's substring grep -F is sufficient for cohort onboarding under invariant 7's <30-min SLO. Owns: 024B-extras-2 slice. Does NOT gate 024C.\n326:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-RESTORE-FILE-TOCTOU-001** (open): `scripts/enable-required-check.sh` reads RESTORE_PRE_STATE file three separate times (cat to RESTORE_TARGET_JSON, validate_restore_source_json, inline Python signatures extract). Mitigation: read once into a variable and pipe content to validate + signature-extract via stdin. Defensive hardening; current posture-degradation flag gates bound the blast radius. Owner: 024B-extras-2 slice; does NOT gate 024C.\n327:- **TF-024B-EXTRAS-2-WORKFLOW-PIN-BASE-BRANCH-001** (open): `.github/workflows/check-invocation-log-entry.yml` invokes `scripts/check-invocation-log-entry.sh` from the PR's checked-out code (PR HEAD), not the base branch. For future multi-operator adoption, pin enforcement to `git show origin/main:scripts/check-invocation-log-entry.sh | bash -s -- ...` or use a reusable workflow from base. Owner: 024B-extras-2 slice (depth-defense); does NOT gate 024C.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
